        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add shadow root reference target information]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42323</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42323"/>
        <updated>2025-12-09T16:28:06.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/939727?u=2e25f47c213a7e8f2e4e57ddd4ee59ba6601eae3&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Adds brief summaries of <code class="notranslate">referenceTarget</code> on <code class="notranslate">attachShadow()</code> and <code class="notranslate">ShadowRoot</code>, and <code class="notranslate">shadowrootreferencetarget</code> on <code class="notranslate">&lt;template&gt;</code>.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">Implemented experimentally in Chrome and positive signals from Mozilla and funding to implement in WebKit as well as progress in the HTML and WHATNOT arenas.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Explainer: <a href="https://github.com/WICG/webcomponents/blob/gh-pages/proposals/reference-target-explainer.md">https://github.com/WICG/webcomponents/blob/gh-pages/proposals/reference-target-explainer.md</a></li>
<li>HTML progress: <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2592669740" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10707" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/whatwg/html/issues/10707/hovercard" href="https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10707">whatwg/html#10707</a></li>
<li>WHATNOT progress: <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3403461116" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/11648" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/whatwg/html/issues/11648/hovercard?comment_id=3293932780&amp;comment_type=issue_comment" href="https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/11648#issuecomment-3293932780">whatwg/html#11648 (comment)</a></li>
<li>Chrome implementation status: <a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5188237101891584" rel="nofollow">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5188237101891584</a></li>
<li>Positive signal from Mozilla: <a href="https://mozilla.github.io/standards-positions/#1035" rel="nofollow">https://mozilla.github.io/standards-positions/#1035</a></li>
<li>Plans for WebKit implementation: <a href="https://blogs.igalia.com/mrego/solving-cross-root-aria-issues-in-shadow-dom/" rel="nofollow">https://blogs.igalia.com/mrego/solving-cross-root-aria-issues-in-shadow-dom/</a></li>
</ul>]]></content>
